WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
- [Gary] Stop focusing on dumb shit

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.100
and just keep moving

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.200
and don't be scared of breaking anything

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.860
and don't think about perfection

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:08.620
and there is no perfect way

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.120
to cross your T's and dot your I's

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.180
and don't be crippled

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:12.420
and don't be romantic

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.780
and just move and have no seconds to breathe

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.180
and just schedule on schedule on schedule

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:17.880
five minute meetings

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:18.600
ten minute meetings

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.280
three minute meetings

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.220
eight minute meetings

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.260
and just move.

